# The 100 pps ping above is near the resolution floor: at sampling=256 (testbed_topo.py's
# rate, deliberately kept) each switch emits a sample about every 2.5 s while the reporting
# window is 1 s, so many windows legitimately contain no sample and read 0.0. That is the
# sampling rate, not the wiring. iperf3 raises the packet rate by ~3 orders of magnitude.
